  "kind": "technology",
  "description": {
    "en": "Silicon heterojunction cell with thin amorphous silicon layers on both faces of an n-type wafer, usually bifacial. Reference: REC Alpha Pure-R (80 half-cut cells). Meyer Burger WHITE (120 half cells, SmartWire) is a second sourced HJT product (see cell note and md file).",
    "es": "Celda de heterounion de silicio con capas finas de silicio amorfo en ambas caras de una oblea tipo n, normalmente bifacial. Referencia: REC Alpha Pure-R (80 celulas partidas). Meyer Burger WHITE (120 medias celulas, SmartWire) es un segundo producto HJT documentado (ver nota de celda y el archivo md)."
  },
  "typical_use": "Premium utility and residential modules with low temperature coefficient and bifacial output.",
